WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.600 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Understand why Aria says to wait.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.814 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Begin by checking the market and timeframe.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.800 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Open Aria to inspect its checks.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.822 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Read the market conditions before

00:00:18.822 --> 00:00:20.136 line:92% position:50% size:90%
looking at the score.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.174 line:92% position:50% size:90%
A passed gate means one rule matched.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.292 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Now read a condition that failed.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.374 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Read the verdict, including any restriction.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.336 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Ask what evidence would invalidate this idea.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.340 line:92% position:50% size:90%
In this example, we wait

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.500 line:92% position:50% size:90%
and leave the ticket alone.

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:57.120 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Bring your reasoning to the lesson.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.570 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Matching checks cannot guarantee results.
